        "title": "Funzioni applicate 1",
        "type": "practiceLevel2",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148214,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché è utile aggiungere un'istruzione <code>if</code> all'interno di una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ci permette di modificare il comportamento della funzione in base a una condizione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">È come aggiungere qualsiasi altra istruzione all'interno di una funzione</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rende la nostra funzione più breve e facile da leggere</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ci permette di modificare il comportamento della funzione in base a una condizione.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148215,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione con il valore (argomento) che visualizzerà <code>\"Level up!\"</code> nella console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"65\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"129\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkXP\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"xp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (xp &lt;= \" /><text value=\"65\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Keep grinding...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level up!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkXP(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148216,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi l'istruzione <code>if</code> in modo che entrambi i messaggi vengano stampati nella console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isEnemySpotted\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"spotted\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Scanning the area...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (spotted === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spotted!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isEnemySpotted(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>, seguito da <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148217,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione con l'argomento che comporterà un aumento del danno del 10%.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"239\" endIndex=\"242\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"boostedDamage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"damage\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boost;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (damage &gt; \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  boost = damage * \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  damage = damage - boost;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (damage &gt;= \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  boost = damage * \" /><text value=\"0.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  damage = damage - boost;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(damage);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boostedDamage(\" /><text value=\"800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>800</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148218,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa l'istruzione condizionale per applicare una penalità alla resistenza all'energia passata a <code>getAdjustedEnergy()</code> quando supera 2.500.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(currentEnergy &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(currentEnergy &gt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(energy &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getAdjustedEnergy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"energy\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (energy &gt; \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  energy = energy - (energy * \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" energy;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentEnergy = getAdjustedEnergy(\" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(currentEnergy);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(energy &gt; 2500)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148219,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi l'istruzione condizionale per applicare, se appropriato, un bonus per principianti.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"applyNewbieBonus\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyNewbieBonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &lt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level + \" /><text value=\"&quot;: newbie bonus applies!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applyNewbieBonus(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>level</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;=</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148220,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Costruisci la condizione all'interno dell'istruzione <code>if</code> in modo che corrisponda correttamente all'output.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkHighScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a &gt;= b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(a + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is greater than or equal to &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + b);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkHighScore(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>a</code> e poi <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148221,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi l'istruzione <code>if else</code> per completare la funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a &gt;= b)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkHitboxOverlap\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a === b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hitboxes match&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hitboxes don't match&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkHitboxOverlap(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if (a === b)</code>, seguito da <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148222,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>Entering game...</code> nella console chiamando la funzione con il codice di accesso corretto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;swordfish&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"171\" /><option startIndex=\"171\" endIndex=\"172\" /><option startIndex=\"172\" endIndex=\"183\" /><option startIndex=\"183\" endIndex=\"184\" /><option startIndex=\"184\" endIndex=\"185\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkAccessCode\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"code\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (code === \" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Entering game...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Access denied, try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkAccessCode(\" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>checkAccessCode</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>\"party1999\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148223,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è lo scopo di un'istruzione <code>return</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Restituire un valore da una funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per visualizzare un valore nella console</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Chiamare una funzione definita in precedenza</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Restituire un valore da una funzione.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148224,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando un'istruzione return viene inserita prima delle istruzioni in una funzione, cosa succede quando la funzione viene chiamata?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Le istruzioni dopo l'istruzione return non vengono eseguite</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Le istruzioni prima dell'istruzione return non vengono eseguite</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La funzione non è valida e non verrà eseguita affatto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Le istruzioni dopo l'istruzione return non vengono eseguite.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148225,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale/i istruzione/i return viene/vengono eseguita/e in questo codice?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addTenToScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Adding ten points to &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score + \" /><text value=\"&quot;.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = addTenToScore(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La prima istruzione return</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La seconda istruzione return</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Entrambe le istruzioni return</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La prima istruzione return.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148226,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza il messaggio <code>Perfect run</code> posizionando le istruzioni return nel punto corretto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"110\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isPerfectRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &gt;= \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Perfect run&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Not a perfect run&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPerfectRun(\" /><text value=\"98\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return \"Perfect run\";</code>, seguito da <code>return \"Not a perfect run\";</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148227,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esegui l'ultima istruzione return inserendo il valore corretto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"300\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"177\" endIndex=\"180\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"tuneGameSpeed\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"speed\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (speed &lt; \" /><text value=\"375\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too slow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (speed &gt; \" /><text value=\"425\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too fast&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Just right&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = tuneGameSpeed(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
